WEBVTT

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.390
Renge! Where are you headed?

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.990
I'm gonna play with Shiori-chan.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.120
Oh, okay. Be safe.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.990
I'll keep Shiori-chan safe!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:59.530
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.480
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.480
<b>I Got Drunk and Remembered</b>

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.440
Shiori-chan, don't run 
so fast! You'll trip!

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.330
It's okay! I won't trip!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:22.350
You're being conceited, Shiori-chan.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.160
I thought that when I was little, too,

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.820
but people do trip and fall.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:29.050
Really?

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.230
You gotta keep an eye on what's 
around you and walk carefully.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:34.960
Okay, I will!

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.210
She wasn't listening at all!

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.660
Shiori-chan, what are you doing?!

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.130
Look, Renge-chan!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.430
I found some weird thing!

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:48.640
It's a praying mantis's egg sac.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.250
That's what this is?

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:54.730
Do you think I can give it to my baby 
sister as a gift when she's born?

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.160
I don't think a baby would 
be ready for one of these.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:58.450
Really?

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.960
Really.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.220
I see...

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:03.930
I need to go home now.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.510
Is something going on?

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.620
It's my nap time.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.480
I see.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.810
I live right over there. 
Can you make it home by yourself?

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:14.610
Yeah, I'll be fine!

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.250
Bye-bye, Renge-chan!

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.170
Bye-bye!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.820
What are you guys doing at my house?

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:35.970
Hey, Ren-chon.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.800
We just came over to play.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.350
Where were you?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.960
I was playing with Shiori-chan.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.490
Oh, yeah?

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.690
You're not too tired to 
play some more, are you?

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.610
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.680
I am the child of playtime.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.410
I don't have time to get 
tired out that easily.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:58.660
Let's play dodgeball! I'll get the ball!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.590
Okay.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.460
Whew, I'm exhausted.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.150
And I never got to hit Natsumi.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.200
It was fun, though.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.650
By the way, why didn't your 
brother come, Nattsun?

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:09.730
Oh, Nii-chan's studying for entrance exams.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.830
That's right, he'll be in 
high school next year.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.190
Has he decided where he's going?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.880
Somewhere close by, he said.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:19.090
It does take a while to get 
there by train, though.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:24.520
I guess that means I'll be the 
oldest one at school next year...

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.060
That's a lot of responsibility.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.290
I don't think it's <i>that </i>
much responsibility.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:33.430
It's all in how you think about it!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:41.500
Come to think of it, Shiori-chan said 
she's gonna have a baby sister soon.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.830
Really?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:43.970
Uh-huh.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.040
I'm gonna be even more of an onee-san.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.760
Let's play dodgeball one more time.

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:02.710
I'm gonna get better at it and 
teach Shiori-chan how to play.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:08.930
Okay!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:12.000
I'm rested up, so let's get back to it!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:12.760
Yeah!

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:16.830
Nattsun, Hotarun, Koma-chan! 
Let's play dodgeball!

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:18.780
Here it comes, Ren-chan!

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.810
Better get ready, Koma-chan!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.780
I won't go down that easily!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:45.500
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.130
Hello?

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.860
Oh, Senpai. What's up?

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.420
What? Drinks?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:55.940
I've been busy getting ready 
for the graduation ceremony,

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.400
so I wanted a little change of pace.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:01.610
<i>Sure, that's fine. Where will we be drinking?</i>

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.560
Oh, at my house.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.100
<i>When should I be there?</i>

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:08.560
Hmm... We should wait until Renge's asleep,

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:11.760
so it'll be a bit late, but around 10 PM?

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:15.120
<i>10 PM? Are you planning to drink all night?</i>

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.820
Nah, not that long.

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.640
Okay, well, I'll be there.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.690
<i>All right. I'll be waiting.</i>

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.800
Drinking, huh?

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:30.820
Well, I guess a few drinks 
now and then can't hurt.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.560
<b>Handmade</b>

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.560
<b>Hiyori</b>

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.560
<b>Imo
Shochu</b>

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.540
I drank too... much...

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.250
Oh, boy. You okay, Kaede?

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:52.740
Maybe mixing shochu and 
beer was a bad idea...

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:57.320
You didn't tell me you 
had so much shochu...

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.550
I had a lot of it left over,

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:03.710
so I thought this would be a 
good time to crack it open.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:08.390
I shouldn't have come home just 
because I'm on break after exams.

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:11.600
Don't get wasted together and 
make my life miserable, okay?

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:13.520
What, now?

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:17.280
I just said I drank too much. 
I didn't say I was drunk.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.830
You obviously are!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.600
No, you know what?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.290
If I was really drunk...

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.730
Huh, I feel dizzy. Why do I feel dizzy?

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:35.570
Because you've been drinking.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.040
Oh, it's everything else 
that's shaking, not me.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.420
Yeah, you're sloshed.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:50.080
I didn't think I had <i>that</i> much to drink...

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:53.020
You okay? Want some water?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:54.600
Yes, please.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:59.310
Damn it. If Renge saw me like this...

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.680
Oh, then maybe I should 
get a video of this.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.130
What do you mean, "<i>then</i> maybe"?

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:08.410
Hey. Don't point that phone at me.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.070
Hmm, what to do?

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.620
Hey, what's up?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.350
Why are you up at this hour, Renge?

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:22.790
Well, I was thirsty, so I 
came to drink some milk.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.590
Milk? Okay, I'll get you some. Wait here.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.170
Here.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.330
I didn't know you were here, Candy Store.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.440
I wanna hang out with you, too.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:41.590
Yeah, I know how you feel, but it's late.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:42.960
I'll play with you tomorrow.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.180
You'll play with me tomorrow?

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:47.650
The store'll be closed for the day.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:50.090
Okay. I'll go to bed, then.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.940
Goodnight.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.310
Yeah, goodnight.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.830
Hikage, get me some water.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.080
You just got that milk by yourself!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:05.920
Yeah, the moment I stood 
up, the liquor hit me...

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.540
Everything is spinning...

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.010
Here, Candy Store. Water.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:19.510
You didn't have to push yourself like 
that just because Ren-chon came in.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.800
What're you talking about?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:26.470
It'd set a bad example for a 
little kid to see me like this.

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:30.900
Well, I pass out drunk in front 
of Ren-chon all the time.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.280
Should a teacher really be like that?

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.350
You gotta get your act together!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:41.120
You do like Renge a lot, huh?

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:48.120
I feel like I've heard that 
at some point before...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.710
Milky Cookies

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:56.710
Here, Renge.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:59.220
I brought you more cookies.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:01.830
There.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:11.380
Don't be so hasty. There's plenty more.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:16.870
Hey, Candy Store, do you enjoy 
taking care of babies that much?

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.320
Huh? Where'd that come from?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.840
It's not fun.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.910
I just came to play with her 
because I had spare time.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.830
But you've been coming over 
pretty much every day.

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.470
So what? Got a problem with that?

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.570
No, it's not that...

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:37.600
Hika-nee! We're here to play!

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:40.850
Okay, we can play in my room.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:41.730
Yay!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:46.520
Oh?

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:48.730
You're here, too, Kaede-chan?

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.730
Do you want... to...

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:52.930
Oh, it's Renge-chan!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.900
Look, it's me, Konomi!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.110
Oh, I wouldn't do that.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:02.270
Renge gets fussy pretty quick with 
people she doesn't know well.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.110
Even me, at first.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:09.080
Aw, you remember me!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.530
W-Well...

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:16.890
I guess she's in a good mood right now, 
since I was just playing with her.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:20.500
Really? She was like this the 
last time I saw her, though.

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:25.470
I bet you scared her with that 
surly attitude you have.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.220
I'm not surly!

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.970
Okay, just watch! I'll show 
you how much Renge likes me!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:34.450
Come on, Renge. Come to me.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.660
Renge, over here.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.450
That's it. Good girl, Renge.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:46.290
Renge-chan, not that way. Come this way.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.280
She came to me!

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:55.920
Hey, that's not fair! I called to her first!

00:12:56.150 --> 00:13:00.410
I know. I just wondered what would 
happen if I tried it, too.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:03.610
You have a pretty mean side 
to you, you know that?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.450
Okay, this time, we'll compete using toys!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.850
Compete? For what?

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:13.310
I have her favorite plushie. 
She's sure to come over here.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:17.760
That's it! See? 
I have your favorite plushie!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:20.830
I don't know about competing with toys...

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.240
Okay, then I'll use this rattle.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.120
Renge-chan, how about this?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.170
<i>I remember that rattle.</i>

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:34.910
<i>When it makes noise while Renge's doing 
something else, she gets really mad.</i>

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:38.490
<i>And right now, she's playing 
with her plushie.</i>

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.470
<i>Maybe I should tell her 
that's a bad idea...</i>

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:46.800
<i>But if she goes through with it, I'll win.</i>

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.820
No.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:57.120
K-Konomi, I wouldn't use that rattle.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:14:00.140
When you use that, 
she gets really mad and...

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.850
Wow, she really likes it!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:08.080
Why?! I thought she hated that one!

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:10.890
Why are you shouting like that?

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.820
You'll scare Renge-chan.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:18.490
Like I said before, 
your face is just too scary.

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:20.500
Try to be more like this.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.550
Peek-a...

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:23.750
Boo!

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.680
See? Why don't you try that?

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.000
Huh? Do that?

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:37.270
Peek-a...

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.150
Boo.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.950
I'm gonna go play with Hikage!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.030
Renge, if you start to miss me, too bad!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:05.150
Aw, Kaede-chan left.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.330
Want to play with me, then?

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:19.140
What are you doing, Candy Store?

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.970
Uh, I was just... Nothing.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:24.980
Kaede-chan, you're right there?

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.970
If you're worried about 
Renge-chan, just come in.

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:30.230
No... I'm not worried...

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.670
Come on, just get in here.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:35.370
I just said I'm not worried...

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:38.900
What's wrong, Renge-chan?

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.660
What? What happened?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.510
I don't know. She just started crying.

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.520
Come on, don't cry.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.600
Give her to me for now.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:47.590
O-Okay...

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:51.080
What's wrong, Renge? It's okay.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.550
There, there.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.880
There, there. It's okay.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:59.890
There, there. There, there.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.290
There, there.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.630
There, there, there.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.390
There, there.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:07.430
There, there, there.

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:09.420
There, there.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.440
There, there...

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.960
Huh? She fell asleep?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.950
Maybe she was crying because she was tired.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:32.120
Really? But she didn't stop 
when I picked her up.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:35.830
I guess she really trusts 
you after all, Kaede-chan.

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:50.480
Oh, we need to get her futon ready.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.720
Right.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.150
Candy Store...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.200
You really like Renge a lot, huh?

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.900
I do not!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.360
Not so loud.

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:09.240
Renge's not a little baby you can soothe 
to sleep when she cries anymore.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:14.320
She's even looking out for a kid 
who's younger than her now.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.210
Want some more water?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:27.550
Hikage...

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:32.780
Do you remember when you started 
going to the branch school?

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:35.730
Huh? What now? What is this?

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:39.730
You were about as big then as Renge is now.

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:42.690
You were an uncontrollable little brat,

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:47.240
but now, you're looking 
out for me like this.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:51.130
You really have grown up.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:57.640
I hear Konomi's worked really hard in the 
wind instruments club for three years, too.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:03.530
And Komari's doing her best to be a 
good big sister, in her own way.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:09.090
Hotaru-chan's adapted well 
to her new environment,

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:11.470
and she's made friends with the other kids.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.640
And Natsumi...

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:18.460
Yeah. They're all good kids.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:19.700
Oh, crap!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:23.190
She started reflecting on the past, 
and now she's even complimenting Natsumi!

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:25.040
Wh-What do we do, Nee-chan?

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.510
Was she complimenting Natsumi?

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:28.990
I get why that's scary.

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:31.380
H-Hey, Kaede.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:34.960
I'll get you a futon. 
Why don't we call it a night?

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.380
Senpai...

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:40.330
I'm really grateful to you, too.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:44.280
Like back then...

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.460
W-Wait, wait, wait! 
You can't be serious, Kaede!

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:52.940
Are you crying?!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.900
Candy Store, I can't sleep.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.620
What's up, Renge? You can't fall asleep?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:03.810
This is gonna get ugly! 
Hikage, put her to bed!

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:06.600
Hey, Renge! Come sleep with me tonight!

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:07.380
'Kay.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.730
I got Renge to fall asleep.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:24.020
Good. Kaede seems to be calming down, too.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:27.630
I never thought Candy Store 
would get this drunk.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:30.660
Well, these things happen sometimes.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:36.980
Back in the day, Kaede was 
